// Copy to Signing.xcconfig (same folder; git ignores it) and put your Apple
// developer team's ID here: ten letters and digits, shown under Membership at
// developer.apple.com/account, or in Xcode > Settings > Accounts. A free
// Apple ID has a "personal team" with an ID too.
//
// With it set, `flutter build ios` and `flutter run` sign for a real device
// (Automatic signing). The bundle identifier is dev.uconnect.mobile; a team
// that does not own it has to change PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER as well, here:
//
//   PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.example.uconnect
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
